# --- Research data and model binaries ----------------------------------------
# The training corpora and checkpoints run to several gigabytes, and individual
# files exceed GitHub's 100 MB limit. The scripts that build them, the configs
# that trained on them and every measurement taken from them ARE committed, so
# the work is auditable and reproducible; the raw text and the intermediate
# checkpoints are not redistributed. Much of the human corpus came from sources
# with their own licence terms that do not permit republication.
#
# The one model the tool actually ships — the 33 MB per-channel int8 build the
# browser runs — is committed deliberately, so a clone can run the detector.
# The 128 MB fp32 model the server runs is published as a release asset.
services/local-engine/research/**/*.jsonl
services/local-engine/research/**/*.parquet
services/local-engine/research/**/*.safetensors
services/local-engine/research/**/*.bin
services/local-engine/research/**/*.pt
services/local-engine/research/**/raw/
services/local-engine/research/**/checkpoint/
services/local-engine/research/**/*-checkpoint/
*.onnx
!services/local-engine/research/models/tier3-cycle2-e5small-int8-perchannel.onnx
